.4, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "some common land visible", "x": 52.35, "y": 92.22, "w": 16.96, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "from her kitchen", "x": 52.02, "y": 93.5, "w": 10.4, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "window.", "x": 63.78, "y": 93.5, "w": 4.92, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "At first I saw nothing, but he", "x": 73.54, "y": 26.58, "w": 18.39, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "continued to bark and", "x": 73.48, "y": 27.9, "w": 13.98, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "wouldn't move which made", "x": 73.48, "y": 29.22, "w": 18.06, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "me stand still. What I saw", "x": 73.57, "y": 30.54, "w": 16.56, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "next is a mystery. 'My god", "x": 73.51, "y": 31.86, "w": 17.2, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "it's a big bubble, were my", "x": 73.57, "y": 33.18, "w": 16.55, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "first thoughts.' I was about", "x": 73.51, "y": 34.5, "w": 16.96, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "25 yards away from it and", "x": 73.57, "y": 35.82, "w": 16.75, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "what I saw was approxi-", "x": 73.57, "y": 37.14, "w": 15.38, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "mately 2 ft across, transpar-", "x": 73.57, "y": 38.46, "w": 17.34, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ent with two central bright", "x": 73.51, "y": 39.77, "w": 16.93, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "lights inside it, it just seemed", "x": 73.57, "y": 41.09, "w": 18.38, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "to be floating, travelling", "x": 73.54, "y": 42.41, "w": 15.3, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "around 10-15 mph and less", "x": 73.54, "y": 43.73, "w": 17.41, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "than 20 feet up. It was silent.", "x": 73.57, "y": 45.05, "w": 18.39, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "It just seemed to roll, chang-", "x": 73.57, "y": 46.37, "w": 17.83, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ing shape as it moved but", "x": 73.57, "y": 47.69, "w": 16.33, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the lights remained in the", "x": 73.54, "y": 49.01, "w": 16.25, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "centre.", "x": 73.48, "y": 50.33, "w": 4.51, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "The request published in the", "x": 73.08, "y": 53.64, "w": 19.59, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "paper encouraged other resi-", "x": 73.17, "y": 54.85, "w": 19.51, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "dents to respond.", "x": 73.11, "y": 56.06, "w": 12.2, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Like your reader, / went to get my", "x": 73.11, "y": 58.56, "w": 19.42, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "dog from the garden because he", "x": 73.08, "y": 59.77, "w": 18.49, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was barking to come in as I stepped", "x": 73.14, "y": 60.99, "w": 20.58, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "outside / saw this large something", "x": 73.08, "y": 62.2, "w": 19.56, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "glowing and moving slowly across", "x": 73.08, "y": 63.41, "w": 19.9, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the sky. It appeared to be completely", "x": 73.11, "y": 64.63, "w": 20.96, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "orange in colour and totally silent", "x": 73.14, "y": 65.84, "w": 19.54, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ruling out an airplane or helicopter.", "x": 73.17, "y": 67.05, "w": 20.75, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "I called my daughter to come and", "x": 73.17, "y": 69.56, "w": 19.24, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "see, and we both watched the craft", "x": 73.11, "y": 70.77, "w": 19.96, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "until it was just a dot on the hori-", "x": 73.17, "y": 71.99, "w": 18.76, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "zon.", "x": 73.08, "y": 73.2, "w": 2.57, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Friends thought we had lost it when", "x": 73.23, "y": 75.65, "w": 20.6, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "we told them what we saw but my", "x": 73.2, "y": 76.86, "w": 19.42, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "daughter and I know it was no ordi-", "x": 73.11, "y": 78.07, "w": 20.38, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "nary aircraft. It was indeed an", "x": 73.14, "y": 79.29, "w": 17.5, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "unidentified flying object.", "x": 73.17, "y": 80.5, "w": 14.77, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "/ hoped someone might write to the", "x": 73.2, "y": 82.97, "w": 20.26, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Herald and I'm glad they did.", "x": 73.23, "y": 84.18, "w": 17.34, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "I live in the Amington area and", "x": 73.2, "y": 86.6, "w": 17.82, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "would be interested to know if any-", "x": 73.23, "y": 87.82, "w": 19.72, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "one else observed this object.", "x": 73.2, "y": 89.03, "w": 17.01, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Patrick Simpson Polesworth.", "x": 77.49, "y": 91.43, "w": 16.88, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}]}